{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25507","headline":"山信至说平泉别墅草木滋长地转幽深怅然思归复此作 · 李德裕","name":"山信至说平泉别墅草木滋长地转幽深怅然思归复此作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻樵客语，暂慰野人心。\n幽径芳兰密，闲庭秀木深。\n麕䴥来涧底，凫鹄遍川浔。\n谁念沧溟上，归欤起叹音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}